{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41772259\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"纵向揭示FOG恶化过程中小脑—中脑运动区及DLPFC—MLR有效连接的动态变化，可提供STN之外的竞争性网络机制和代偿机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41783853\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述总结DLPFC、MPFC及额叶网络异常与FOG的关系，可补充STN活动之外的皮层—基底节环路机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41802976\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅研究BSN基因变异与PD步态及FOG的临床关联，未涉及STN神经活动或能够解释STN-FOG关系的神经环路机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41810591\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接测量DBS患者STNβ振荡并揭示药物与刺激状态对其功率及生物标志物预测效能的影响，可解释不同STN信号研究之间的状态依赖性差异。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41815489\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究的是PD脑电半球不对称性与一般步态损害的关联，未涉及FOG特异性或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41827492\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然综述涉及FOG及其神经解剖基础，但主要关注AR/VR辅助治疗和可穿戴技术，未提供STN活动与FOG关系的实质性神经生理证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41849339\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅为比较不同节律性听觉刺激的DBS研究方案，尚无STN/GPi局部场电位与步态之间的实际研究结果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41850899\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅涉及POLG相关帕金森综合征对DBS的治疗反应，现有题目信息未显示FOG或STN神经活动方面的相关证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41854085\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述主要讨论PD广泛的胆碱能系统异常及治疗潜力，未具体涉及FOG或STN相关神经环路。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41856255\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然在MPTP大鼠模型中观察到STN过度激活，但未测量或分析FOG，不能建立STN活动与冻结步态之间的联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41857020\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"动物模型直接记录皮层—STNβ振荡传播及不同频率DBS的调节效应，可作为PD一般性STNβ病理和刺激参数效应的机制对照，帮助判断β活动是否具有FOG特异性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41866810\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接发现FOG患者右侧胆碱能基底前脑萎缩，为FOG提供STN之外的胆碱能网络机制及半球侧化证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41891752\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"揭示自愿停步与FOG事件识别的混淆，并证明眼动信息能够改善区分能力，可帮助控制STN-FOG关联研究中的事件标注和表型测量误差。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41919631\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述总结aDBS生物标志物的个体差异、LFP信号伪迹及阈值和响应延迟问题，可帮助解释STN神经信号研究及闭环刺激结果的异质性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41931955\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过视频验证区分FOG发作前、发作中及发作后的运动特征，为研究STN神经活动与FOG之间的时相关系、事件定义及任务依赖性提供重要表型依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41933910\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究磁机械方式刺激小鼠STN后的运动功能恢复，但未研究冻结步态或STN神经活动与FOG的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41938069\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接测量PD-FOG患者接受视觉和听觉线索时的皮层血氧活动及功能连接变化，可提供FOG相关皮层网络机制，与STN机制形成比较。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41957027\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"提供基于症状日记和可穿戴加速度计的PD运动症状数据集，虽包含FOG记录，但不涉及神经活动或STN相关机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41977827\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述主要关注可穿戴设备和机器学习对FOG的检测及预测，aDBS仅作为未来应用方向，缺乏STN神经生理机制方面的实质性证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41983317\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究帕金森病小鼠模型中的磁遗传刺激及皮层—基底节—丘脑环路振荡，但未报告FOG或其与STN活动的关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41987849\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述主要讨论BCI技术在多种神经精神疾病中的应用，PD仅为涉及的疾病之一，未提供FOG或STN特异性证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42009672\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究STN-DBS对PD皮层亚稳态动力学及一般运动症状的影响，但未评估步态或FOG，无法确定相关网络变化是否与冻结步态有关。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42021831\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述主要关注机器学习预测PD患者DBS术后临床结局，虽涉及部分步态指标，但没有FOG特异性或STN神经活动证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42035827\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究非人灵长类腹侧STN在价值决策中的促进性活动，但不涉及PD、步态或FOG，其行为任务和STN功能分区与研究问题距离较远。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42041795\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者药物ON/OFF状态下的一般步态运动学变化，未提供FOG事件特异性分析或STN神经活动数据。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c99d53c8-13bf-4390-b9c9-65a2930a5f25", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T135814129028Z", "elapsed_seconds": 168.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T14:01:03.015326+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "55de64260feef3ffbea3ead91c278f437537087dbae29e95042b2c41fb94323d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T135814129028Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ce44880799a8b66cf6592454ab26bbb1c61e9064201446c7f9e3f8c084c8f778"}}}
